# HAYA FerdausMix YouTube Pipeline (Required)

Reference channel: https://www.youtube.com/@FerdausMix  
Research docs: `research/ferdaus_mix/ANALYSIS.md`, `research/ferdaus_mix/PIPELINE.md`

## Distribution (locked)

- **YouTube only** — no RouteNote / Spotify for now (same model as FerdausMix).
- Public release = **~30–36 min DJ mix** of **9–10 tracks**.
- Individual ~2 min masters are building blocks; one master per song folder.

## Generation (locked)

1. **ACE-Step** pure `text2music` with `batch_deephouse/natural_vocal_recipe.py` only
2. Thinking LM on (`acestep-5Hz-lm-1.7B`), **120s**, short sticky Arabic hook, ~108 BPM
3. Generate **2 seeds**, keep the amazing take, delete the other
4. **Do not** use: DiffRhythm hybrid, Suno, YuE, or FerdausMix extended-club / drop-map prompts  
   (Mulki 122 BPM experiment rejected — ditch that approach)

Approved masters: Hawa, Rouh, Ward, Shouf, Baid (+ Noor, Yalil).

## Post-production for YouTube mix

1. Collect 9–10 approved masters  
2. Hard-cut concat with `research/ferdaus_mix/scripts/compile_mix.py`  
3. Package under `batch_deephouse/output/<mix_slug>/`

## Title template

`Dark Mood — {ArabicTitle} | Arabic Deep Chill House Mix 2026 • Vocal House / Night Vibes`

## Style

Arabic deep chill house, dark emotional night drive, female Arabic vocal, warm sub bass, four-on-the-floor, ~108 BPM.
